  "schema_version":"0.3.0","card_type":"agent","id":"enterprise-research-agent-v1","name":"企業市場研究 Promptless Agent","description":"依企業研究目標自主規劃研究、選用工具、交叉驗證並產出可追溯報告。","language":"zh-TW",
